  Civic Tech Toronto (https://civictech.ca/)\n\nWhat does it take to build
  a less lonely city? Can we scale human connection the same way we scale a
  tech startup? This talk explores an approach to community building rooted
  in the idea that nobody owns community\; and the belief that connection
  is grown\, not found.
