DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://allto.ca/event/climate-double-cross/\n\nHosted by Academy for
  Lifelong Learning (https://allto.ca/)\n\nCanada is living through a
  paradoxical moment: public opinion strongly supports climate action\, yet
  many Canadians also back the expansion of new pipelines. Drawing on the
  latest research\, this talk explores how these conflicting views reveal
  Canada’s identity as a petro-state and the complex political landscape
  that shapes our national climate choices.
