SUMMARY:Be Ready\, Toronto! Nuclear Emergency Preparedness Session for
  Individuals and Households - by Toronto Public Library
LOCATION:Port Union Library
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ae3bbedad4027659155806e\n\nHoste
 d by Toronto Public Library (https://www.torontopubliclibrary.ca)\n\nWhile
  nuclear emergencies are unlikely\, it is important to understand the
  risks\, know how to stay informed\, and be prepared to take protective
  actions if needed. The Nuclear Emergency Preparedness session is aimed at
